    <string name="Long_Sentence_Rules">Tetrano is a game for two players.\n\nTake turns placing a ring of your color on the board. The first player to line up four rings of their color wins.\n\nA line of four rings can be:\n• concentric: four rings of different sizes in the same square;\n• straight: four rings on a row, a column or a diagonal, either all the same size, or in increasing or decreasing size.\n\nTo play, drag a ring from below the board and drop it on a square.\n\nHave fun!</string>
